        <title type="html"><![CDATA[FF153 Relnote RTCTransportStats]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44478</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44478"/>
        <updated>2026-06-16T11:41:23.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF153 added support for the mandatory (and some optional) transports stats defined in <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCTransportStats" rel="nofollow">RTCTransportStats</a> in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1225723" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1225723</a> and <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2019389" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2019389</a></p>
<p dir="auto">This adds a release note, indicating the supported properties:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCTransportStats/id" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">RTCTransportStats.id</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCTransportStats/type" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">RTCTransportStats.type</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCTransportStats/timestamp" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">RTCTransportStats.timestamp</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCTransportStats/iceRole" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">RTCTransportStats.iceRole</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCTransportStats/iceLocalUsernameFragment" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">RTCTransportStats.iceLocalUsernameFragment</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCTransportStats/dtlsState" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">RTCTransportStats.dtlsState</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCTransportStats/iceState" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">RTCTransportStats.iceState</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCTransportStats/selectedCandidatePairId" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">RTCTransportStats.selectedCandidatePairId</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCTransportStats/dtlsRole" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">RTCTransportStats.dtlsRole</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCTransportStats/srtpCipher" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">RTCTransportStats.srtpCipher</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCTransportStats/tlsVersion" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">RTCTransportStats.tlsVersion</code></a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCTransportStats/dtlsCipher" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">RTCTransportStats.dtlsCipher</code></a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">This also added <code class="notranslate">transportId</code> on the inbound and outbound stats, both remote and local.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4665266371" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44454" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/44454/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44454">#44454</a></p>]]></content>
